                                "sense_id": "3aa7544e-925c-308c-8f61-47a19bc82ef6",
                                "text": "The heavenly bodies may keep their secrets two or three thousand years yet; but one or other of them will betray them to some wakeful favorite, some Endymion beyond Latmos, perhaps in regions undiscovered, certainly in uncalculated times."
                            }
                        ]
